    "Redraw the character in image 1 as a head-and-shoulders portrait, keeping his identity exactly: a lanky cartoon man with long wavy shoulder-length brown hair and a full bushy handlebar moustache, wearing a plain v-neck t-shirt of very dark olive charcoal \u2014 near-black, the same flat dark tone as the t-shirt in image 1. Keep the shape of his face, his hair, his moustache and his colouring identical to image 1, keep both eyes and the whole moustache inside the frame, and keep every colour as muted and desaturated as image 1. The portrait shows him as follows:"
